code/update.py: every `dandi_cache_utils` name used is one this library offers.
usage: update.py [-h] [--base-directory BASE_DIRECTORY] [--testing]
                 [--limit LIMIT]

Update the qualifying-aind-content-ids DANDI cache.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --base-directory BASE_DIRECTORY
                        The directory containing the `sourcedata`,
                        `derivatives` and `logs` directories. Set to the
                        mounted dataset path when run inside the pipeline
                        container; defaults to the repository root.
  --testing             Run in testing mode: process only the first 10 items
                        and write `testing_`-prefixed files instead of the
                        real cache, leaving it untouched. Omit for a complete
                        update.
  --limit LIMIT         Cap the number of new items processed in this run. Use
                        for caches too heavy to clear their backlog in a
                        single run; successive runs then advance through it.
                        Omit to process everything.
